    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/55dc8a0ea8783f41e8ef2c4ef14b7ae6.poster.avif?t=1670948719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/55dc8a0ea8783f41e8ef2c4ef14b7ae6.webm?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/55dc8a0ea8783f41e8ef2c4ef14b7ae6.mp4?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br><br><i>Powered by Unreal Engine Beast Fists features unique 3d fighting experience with innovative mechanics, visuals and music. <br>Intuitive controls, realistic martial arts styles, heavy hits, reactive blocking, ducking, dodging and counter attacks should bring you a lot of fun and enjoyment from the gameplay. <br>Free updates will be coming frequently.<br>Beast Fists currently is all about arena fighting, but with time will be evolved to something much bigger. </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/f8b31f02c9e0735aaee52b4b4497083f.poster.avif?t=1670948719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/f8b31f02c9e0735aaee52b4b4497083f.webm?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/f8b31f02c9e0735aaee52b4b4497083f.mp4?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br><br><br>Beast Fists is a fighting game set in a dystopian world of anthropomorphic creatures fighting to keep their freedom from an increasingly controlling and vicious kingdom regime, ruled by fear. <br><br>Beast World is ruled by fear and authoritarian classes of the Kingdom. The main Beasts are those, who don\u2019t agree with or are forced to face the Authority. However, some of the Beasts are the guards and enforcers of the regime, ready to squash the resistance. Which side will you choose? Which Beast will prevail in the end?<br><br>Beast Fists strives to achieve a Golden Balance between fantasy and reality, both in story and gaming style. There will be realistic fighting VFX in combination with exaggerated Super Moves, both balanced to a satisfying gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/935ee2f94bb20a95f2c8f7eb14d25222.poster.avif?t=1670948719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/935ee2f94bb20a95f2c8f7eb14d25222.webm?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/935ee2f94bb20a95f2c8f7eb14d25222.mp4?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/55dc8a0ea8783f41e8ef2c4ef14b7ae6.poster.avif?t=1670948719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/55dc8a0ea8783f41e8ef2c4ef14b7ae6.webm?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/55dc8a0ea8783f41e8ef2c4ef14b7ae6.mp4?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br><br><i>Powered by Unreal Engine Beast Fists features unique 3d fighting experience with innovative mechanics, visuals and music. <br>Intuitive controls, realistic martial arts styles, heavy hits, reactive blocking, ducking, dodging and counter attacks should bring you a lot of fun and enjoyment from the gameplay. <br>Free updates will be coming frequently.<br>Beast Fists currently is all about arena fighting, but with time will be evolved to something much bigger. </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/f8b31f02c9e0735aaee52b4b4497083f.poster.avif?t=1670948719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/f8b31f02c9e0735aaee52b4b4497083f.webm?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/f8b31f02c9e0735aaee52b4b4497083f.mp4?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br><br><br>Beast Fists is a fighting game set in a dystopian world of anthropomorphic creatures fighting to keep their freedom from an increasingly controlling and vicious kingdom regime, ruled by fear. <br><br>Beast World is ruled by fear and authoritarian classes of the Kingdom. The main Beasts are those, who don\u2019t agree with or are forced to face the Authority. However, some of the Beasts are the guards and enforcers of the regime, ready to squash the resistance. Which side will you choose? Which Beast will prevail in the end?<br><br>Beast Fists strives to achieve a Golden Balance between fantasy and reality, both in story and gaming style. There will be realistic fighting VFX in combination with exaggerated Super Moves, both balanced to a satisfying gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/935ee2f94bb20a95f2c8f7eb14d25222.poster.avif?t=1670948719\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/935ee2f94bb20a95f2c8f7eb14d25222.webm?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093960/extras/935ee2f94bb20a95f2c8f7eb14d25222.mp4?t=1670948719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
